                "1"
              ],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Authenticates a user and returns an access token with basic user profile details.\n\n**Method & Endpoint**\n- `POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/login`\n\n**Required Headers**\n- `Accept: application/json`\n\n**Body Fields**\n- `email` (string): User email address.\n- `password` (string): User password.\n\n**Success Response**\n- `200 OK`: Returns a `token` string and a `user` object containing profile details such as `id`, `first_name`, `last_name`, `name`, `email`, `profile_photo`, `streak_days`, `total_points`, and `exam_target_date`."
          },
